om/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3213\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a UV2 texel density preview view to LightmapGI. It displays a heatmap based on that is the UV texel density vs a media of the whole scene. The target texel desity can be configured in the preview options.\r\nThe preview updates in real time with the lightmap texel density and the meshes texel density. New meshes are not included in the preview, you must close and open it again.\r\nSelected meshes are display with more saturation so they are easy to see for modifications\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1272\" height=\"881\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7c20a10-297f-4c85-9c9b-54a0269e1b0e\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1272\" height=\"881\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5cdeb686-b2cc-47c9-8ae5-6024eda6c518\" />\r\n\r\nIA disclosure:\r\n\r\nAI only used to detect problems and unused part of the code (methods, includes, etc). Code was written and fixed by me","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX"